# Kelly's Fearless Focus plan

This is my plan at the end of the first day, 2026-10-05, written out by the app. My schedules have added today's copy of each routine and habit, and I have marked them done. Chapters 10 and 11 set up the evening review and the weekly planning session: today was the first of both, and they are filled in at the bottom.

FocusPlan: Kelly's Fearless Focus plan
